.nh
.TH "PB-DOMAIN-VERIFY" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-domain-verify - Check a domain's DNS now and wait until it is verified


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb domain verify <domain> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Check a domain's DNS now and wait until it is verified

.PP
Ask the server to check the domain's DNS now and wait (up to --timeout) until it is verified and its certificate is issued, or show why not.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for verify

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=2m0s
	how long to wait for verification and the certificate


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-domain(1)\fP
